    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-13-04",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "国在流沙外者，大夏、竖沙、居繇、月支之国。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-13-05",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "西胡白玉山在大夏东，苍梧在白玉山西南，皆在流沙"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 9,
      "entryId": "chuci-09-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "明。\n\n涉丹水而驰骋兮,\n\n右大夏之遗风。\n\n黄鹄之一举兮,\n\n"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-05-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "；西方曰九区，曰泉泽；西北方曰大夏，曰海泽；北方曰大冥，曰寒泽。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-15-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "。尧《大章》，舜《九韶》，禹《大夏》，汤《大濩》，周《武象》，此"
    }
  ],
